@startuml
title What the backlog holds, and what closes each entry

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 8
}

rectangle "**Specification**, in the repository\nEpics and stories · use cases and their scenarios\nCreation prompts and the tests they deliver" as SPEC #FFF8E1
rectangle "**Backlog**: issues\nOne entry per epic, per story and per increment,\nfound by its identifier" as BACK #E3F2FD
rectangle "**Pull request**\nOne per increment; merging it closes the increment" as PR #C8E6C9
rectangle "**Pipeline**\nGates and tests; a story is closed when its scenarios pass" as PIPE #F4F7F9

SPEC -down-> BACK : generated
BACK -down-> PR : worked on in
PR -down-> PIPE : proven by
@enduml
